{
 "about": "Snapshot spec for the omni-r7 benchmark store (Goods & Co, built on @omni-design/components 0.38.1). Each state is one Figma frame: the whole app (header, page, footer) at a route, with seeded storage, at a viewport. Format: docs/code-to-figma.md, 'The snapshot spec'.",
